.*
.* WRKJOBD and DSPJOBD: the job descriptions of a library or the list,
.* and what one holds.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SYNTAX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HOLD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ENDSEV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SWS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=INQMSG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBPTY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOBQLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTPTY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRTDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LOGLVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LOGSEV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LOGTXT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LOGCLPGM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LOGOUT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ACGCDE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRTTXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RTGDTA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RQSDTA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVRCY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=TSEPOOL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQMX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQFL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWMLT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ASPGRP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SPLFACN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DDMCNV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=INLLIBL CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PADVAR CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=JOBDS VARS='OPT JOBD LIB TEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Repeat position to
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJOBD KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKJOBD ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with Job Descriptions
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=JOBDS.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?CRTJOBD JOBD(&LIB./&JOBD.)'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGJOBD JOBD(&LIB./&JOBD.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD ?CRTDUPOBJ OBJ(&JOBD.) FROMLIB(&LIB.) OBJTYPE(*JOBD)'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTJOBD JOBD(&LIB./&JOBD.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPJOBD JOBD(&LIB./&JOBD.)'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=JOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Description
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=TEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3 and 5 or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJOBD KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPJOBD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Description
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job description
:DATAIX VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User profile
:DATAI VAR=SYNTAX USAGE=OUTPUT.CL syntax check
:DATAI VAR=HOLD USAGE=OUTPUT.Hold on job queue
:DATAI VAR=ENDSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.End severity
:DATAI VAR=JOBDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Job date
:DATAI VAR=SWS USAGE=OUTPUT.Job switches
:DATAI VAR=INQMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Inquiry message reply
:DATAI VAR=JOBPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Job priority (on job queue)
:DATAI VAR=JOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Job queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Output priority (on output queue)
:DATAI VAR=PRTDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer device
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Message logging
:DATAI VAR=LOGLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:DATAI VAR=LOGSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Severity
:DATAI VAR=LOGTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=LOGCLPGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Log CL program commands
:DATAI VAR=LOGOUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Job log output
:DATAI VAR=ACGCDE USAGE=OUTPUT.Accounting code
:DATAI VAR=PRTTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Print text
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=RTGDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Routing data
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=RQSDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Request data
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=DEVRCY USAGE=OUTPUT.Device recovery action
:DATAI VAR=TSEPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Time slice end pool
:DATAI VAR=MSGQMX USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue maximum size
:DATAI VAR=MSGQFL USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue full action
:DATAI VAR=ALWMLT USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow multiple threads
:DATAI VAR=ASPGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Initial ASP group
:DATAI VAR=SPLFACN USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file action
:DATAI VAR=DDMCNV USAGE=OUTPUT.DDM conversation
:DATAI VAR=TEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:DATAI VAR=INLLIBL USAGE=OUTPUT.Initial library list
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=PADVAR USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Maximum temporary storage in megabytes
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJOBD.Work with Job Descriptions - Help
:P.The job descriptions of the libraries asked for. Type an option
next to one, or on the first line with a new name to create one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPJOBD.Display Job Description - Help
:P.What a job description gives the jobs that start from it: who they
run as, where they wait and print, how they log and route.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
